# ========================================================
# Hammer Script Native Library Header - hmhook.lib
# Dedicated Standalone Windows PE Compiler & Linker Subsystem
# ========================================================

# Compiles Hammer Script source code into a true standalone native Windows PE executable (.exe).
# Runs in ~40ms with ZERO external dependencies (no g++, no msys2, no external toolchains required).

# Command line usage:
#   hammer hamhook <source.hmscp> [-o output.exe] [--no-console] [--icon app.ico]
#   hamhook <source.hmscp> [-o output.exe] [--no-console] [--icon app.ico]

# Flags:
#   -o <path>           Specify output executable name/path (defaults to source name .exe)
#   --no-console / -w   Patch PE Subsystem to 2 (IMAGE_SUBSYSTEM_WINDOWS_GUI) for silent GUI execution
#   --icon <ico_path>   Embed native Windows application icon
#   --keep-cpp          Keep intermediate transpiled C++ source for code auditing
